<title>CHINA: Cafe de Coral year net up 16.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Cafe de Coral year net up 16.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)		 27.1 vs 23.3</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)	  10.0 vs 9.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	     29.33 vs 20.57</p>
<p>    Net			     140.995 vs 120.967</p>
<p>    Turnover		     2,037.42 vs 2,016.13</p>
<p>    Company name		 Cafe de Coral Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  Sept 16-23</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   Sept 30</p>
<p>NOTE - The company is a fast food restaurant operator. Net is after an exceptional gain mainly from on sale of properties. Additional amortisation of about HK$5.57 million and HK$4.88 million have been charged to the profit and loss accounts in the current and prior year respectively due to a change in accounting policy and it is expected to be charged in future years.</p>
<p>Comparison figures have been adjusted for the change.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
